---

---

<div class="container">
  <div class="left-column">
    <h3 class="title">
      <span class="color-gradient-blue">Мобильная платформа</span><br
      />подключается к вашей<br />СЭД без разработки<br />с нуля
    </h3>
    <p class="text">
      МП СЭД — готовое коробочное решение для работы с документами и задачами.
      Интегрируется с любой российской системой электронного документооборота:
      1С, Directum, DocsVision, ТЕЗИС и другими.
    </p>
    <div class="banner">
      <img src="/icons/guard.svg" alt="" loading="lazy" decoding="async" />
      <p class="banner__text">
        Готовая мобильная платформа корпоративного уровня на ОС «Аврора»
        корпоративного уровня
      </p>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div class="right-column">
    <div class="companies-column">
      <img
        src="/images/accessToData/eos.png"
        alt="EOS"
        loading="lazy"
        decoding="async"
      />
      <img
        src="/images/accessToData/docvision.png"
        alt="DocsVision"
        loading="lazy"
        decoding="async"
      />
      <img
        src="/images/accessToData/tesis.png"
        alt="ТЕЗИС"
        loading="lazy"
        decoding="async"
      />
      <img
        src="/images/accessToData/1c.png"
        alt="1С"
        loading="lazy"
        decoding="async"
      />
      <img
        src="/images/accessToData/directum.png"
        alt="Directum"
        loading="lazy"
        decoding="async"
      />
    </div>
    <img
      src="/icons/setka.svg"
      alt=""
      class="setka-image"
      loading="lazy"
      decoding="async"
    />
    <img
      src="/images/accessToData/phone.png"
      alt=""
      class="phone-image"
      loading="lazy"
      decoding="async"
    />
    <div class="background-image-container">
      <img
        src="/images/background.jpg"
        alt=""
        class="background-image"
        loading="lazy"
        decoding="async"
      />
    </div>
  </div>

  <style>
    .container {
      display: flex;
      width: 100%;
      height: 532px;
      column-gap: 80px;
      justify-content: space-between;
      padding-top: 100px;
      margin-bottom: 80px;
      border-top: 1px solid transparent;
      border-image: linear-gradient(
          90deg,
          #3b82f600 0%,
          #3b82f680 50%,
          #3b82f600 100%
        )
        1;
    }

    .title {
      margin-bottom: 20px;
    }

    .text {
      color: var(--text-color-secondary);
      line-height: 1.3;
      margin-bottom: 65px;
    }

    .banner {
      display: flex;
      width: 100%;
      column-gap: 20px;
      border: 1px solid transparent;
      padding: 20px;
      border-radius: 20px;
      background:
        linear-gradient(180deg, #09154566 40%, #010619 100%) padding-box,
        linear-gradient(#010619, #010619) padding-box,
        linear-gradient(
            90deg,
            #0036a8 0%,
            #001020 14.29%,
            #0052ff 28.57%,
            #769fff 42.86%,
            #0c41b4 57.14%,
            #0052ff 71.43%,
            #0649d8 85.71%,
            #0c41b4 100%
          )
          border-box;
    }

    .banner__text {
      font-size: 18px;
      line-height: 1.3;
      color: var(--text-color-accent-blue);
    }

    .left-column {
      flex: 0 0 538px;
      width: 538px;
      display: flex;
      flex-direction: column;
    }

    .right-column {
      flex: 1 1 0;
      min-width: 0;
      display: flex;
      justify-content: flex-end;
      position: relative;
      z-index: 1;
    }

    .companies-column {
      display: flex;
      flex-direction: column;
      align-items: flex-end;
      justify-content: space-between;
      align-self: center;
      row-gap: 32px;
    }

    .companies-column img {
      flex: 0 0 auto;
      width: auto;
      height: auto;
      max-width: none;
      z-index: 1;
    }

    .companies-column img:last-child {
      transform: translateY(-6px);
    }

    .phone-image {
      display: block;
      position: relative;
      margin-left: 70px;
      z-index: 1;
      height: 532px;
      width: 200px;
      transform: scale(1.4);
      left: -41px;
      bottom: 35px;
    }

    .setka-image {
      max-height: 281px;
      align-self: center;
      margin-left: 32px;
      z-index: 1;
    }

    .background-image-container {
      position: absolute;
      bottom: -200px;
      right: 0px;
      z-index: 0;
      opacity: 0.5;
      width: 718px;
      height: 300px;
      overflow: hidden;
    }

    .background-image-container::after {
      content: "";
      position: absolute;
      inset: 0;
      z-index: 1;
      pointer-events: none;
      background: linear-gradient(to top, #01061900 0%, #010619 100%);
    }

    .background-image {
      position: absolute;
      inset: 0;
      display: block;
      z-index: 0;
      width: 100%;
      height: 100%;
      max-width: 100%;
      object-fit: fill;
    }
  </style>
</div>
